{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ll build a cel-shaded coastal artillery arcade game, with angle-and-timing shots, changing air and sea targets, and a complete mission circuit. I’ll also include controller-first menus, an AI attract mode, live tuning tools, and the requested credits and test report.\n"}}
