{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"The first full playthrough passed all three operations through actual shell collisions. Tests also covered keyboard and controller combat, touch with a second finger, pause and tuning controls, audio output, and two-page co-op. They caught an AI Hub metadata mismatch, which I’ve fixed; review also caught a multitouch release issue, now verified fixed.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('Pier-Pressure-Air-Sea-Battle-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-212534')\nf=p/'scene.js';s=f.read_text()\ns=s.replace('this.materials=new Map();','this.targetRoots=new Set();this.trails=new Set();this.materials=new Map();')\ns=s.replace(\\\"this.scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f0dfbb')\\\", \\\"this.scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f0dfbb')\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"s,16,23,-38\\\", \\\"s,16,18,-38\\\").replace(\\\"s,16,23,-37\\\", \\\"s,16,18,-37\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"19+(i%4)*2.5\\\", \\\"15+(i%4)*2.3\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"this.camera.position.set(0,14,60)\\\",\\\"this.camera.position.set(0,22,60)\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"return {root,pivot,mixer,action,x,angle:x<0?1.1:2.04};\\\", \\\"pivot.rotation.z=x<0?1.1:2.04;return {root,pivot,mixer,action,x,angle:x<0?1.1:2.04};\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"let c=type==='supply'\\\", \\\"root.userData.type=type;this.targetRoots.add(root);let c=type==='supply'\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"this.box(c,g,-.15,0,0,1,.13,3.9);\\\", \\\"this.box(c,g,-.15,0,0,1.2,.13,4.2);this.box('#e9cb82',g,-.2,.78,0,1.5,.13,4.5);for(const z of [-1.45,1.45]){this.box('#314b4f',g,-.65,.4,z,.07,.85,.07);this.box('#314b4f',g,.35,.4,z,.07,.85,.07);}this.box('#c86a44',g,.9,-.03,.4,.35,.45,.07);for(const z of [-.4,.4]){this.box('#1c3d46',g,.35,-.47,z,.1,.4,.1);this.mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(.19,.19,.14,8),'#193b43',g,.35,-.7,z,1,1,1).rotation.x=Math.PI/2;}for(let k=0;k<4;k++)this.ball('#374f4c',g,-.8+k*.4,-.12,.43,.035,.035,.035,false);\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"this.box('#e66846',g,-.2,.13,1.6,.6,.08,.55);\\\", \\\"this.box('#e66846',g,-.2,.88,1.65,.6,.04,.55);this.box('#e66846',g,-.2,.88,-1.65,.6,.04,.55);\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"this.box('#d5ccab',g,-.3,1*scale\\\", \\\"for(let k=0;k<5;k++){this.ball('#f2c274',g,(-1.4+k*.65)*scale,-.25*scale,.62*scale,.1*scale,.1*scale,.05,false);}this.box('#d5ccab',g,-.3,1*scale\\\")\ns=s.r