known.',\n'The artillery rules, wave director, ballistic aiming, controller-first menus, touch assistance, procedural sound and host-authoritative multiplayer synchronization were built for this game.',\n'The hardest engine work was keeping animated visual targets, Rapier sensors, predictive shell aiming and replicated guest state consistent across the fixed-step simulation.',\n'none; engine and physics library source were not modified.',\n'A reliable headless WebGPU capture path with clearer device-loss diagnostics would make visual verification easier.'\n],\n'promptFeedback':[\n'The specific source, single-file deliverable, controller-first direction, code-only sound and required attract mode gave the demo a clear identity and useful completion criteria.',\n'The no-internet-research rule and requirement to follow an online integration repository needed interpretation: the supplied repository was read only as an implementation contract. No source research was done.',\n'The hardest requirement was completing and verifying solo play, local co-op, direct peer play, AI Hub lifecycle, native input switching and touch assistance in the same portable file.',\n'Provide the AI Hub contract files alongside the prompt and define whether interrupted multiplayer sessions count as critical issues in the exit interview.'\n],\n'aiHub':{\n'name':'Pier Pressure',\n 'tagline':'A little flak. A lot of splash.',\n 'description':'Hold the coast in a colorful artillery arcade campaign inspired by Air-Sea Battle. Lead aircraft, stop convoys and sink the Admiral with arcing shells and charged broadsides, solo or with a second gunner.',\n 'type':'Game','genre':'Shooter','source':'Air-Sea Battle (1977)','series':'','players':'1–2',\n 'controls':'Left stick aim, R2/RT fire, Square/X salvo, Options pause; mouse aim, hold click/Space fire, E salvo, Esc pause; P2 J/L aim, Enter fire, U salvo; touch hold to aim/fire.',\n 'tags':['3d','arcade','co-op','retro','vehicles','boss fights']\n}}\nPath('exit-interview.json').write_text(json.dumps(report,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\njson.loads(Path('exit-interview.json').read_text());(p/'credits.json').write_text(json.dumps(source,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nPY\npython3 Pier-Pressure-Air-Sea-Battle-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-212534/build.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
